1d9191f79d6067a7,2026-11-03T18:00:05+00:00,press,,Tahoe Daily Tribune,RSS feed,,Tahoe Daily Tribune,TRPA takes action on violations,2026-10-30,Article,https://www.tahoedailytribune.com/news/trpa-takes-action-on-violations/,https://www.tahoedailytribune.com/news/trpa-takes-action-on-violations/,,false,10,,0,,,,,,,true,"TRPA takes action on violations LAKE TAHOE, Nev./Calif. – The Tahoe Regional Planning Agency (TRPA) Governing Board yesterday approved two violation settlement agre...",,false,[],"[{""term"": ""TRPA"", ""page"": null, ""text"": ""TRPA takes action on violations LAKE TAHOE, Nev./Calif. – The Tahoe Regional Planning Agency (TRPA) Governing Board yesterday approved two violation settlement agre...""}, {""term"": ""TRPA"", ""page"": null, ""text"": ""...urfboards, also present a risk of invasive species spread as they operate in shallow areas and beaches where mud and weed fragments can be picked up. Under the TRPA Code of Ordinances, all motorized watercraft are required to be inspected and decontaminated at one of the agency’s regional watercraft inspection stations. “T...""}, {""term"": ""TRPA"", ""page"": null, ""text"": ""...s regional watercraft inspection stations. “TRPA’s enforcement program is about protecting Lake Tahoe and the natural resources that make this region special,” TRPA General Counsel Graham St. Michel said. “Whether that means ensuring development and tree removal follow permit requirements or preventing damaging activity in...""}, {""term"": ""TRPA"", ""page"": null, ""text"": ""...The case involved the construction of a new deck and cutting two trees approximately 20 inches in diameter at a residence on Grand Avenue near Homewood, Calif. TRPA supports tree removal for forest health and wildfire safety and has worked with partners on the Tahoe Fire and Fuels Team to make defensible space simple for h...""}, {""term"": ""TRPA"", ""page"": null, ""text"": ""...ion for the illegal construction or, if the application cannot be approved